#, python-format
msgid "The IP of this request was read correctly (%(ip)s)."
msgstr "Die IP dieser Anfrage wurde korrekt gelesen (%(ip)s)."

#: apps/core/sitehealth.py
msgid "unix socket"
msgstr "Unix-Socket"

#: apps/core/sitehealth.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Requests arrive from proxy %(value)s but it is not trusted; all visitors are"
" counted as one IP."
msgstr ""
"Anfragen kommen vom Proxy %(value)s, dem aber nicht vertraut wird; alle "
"Besucher zählen als eine einzige IP."

#: apps/core/sitehealth.py
msgid ""
"Requests arrive from a trusted proxy but have no IP header (X-Forwarded-For "
"or X-Real-IP); the IP cannot be determined and only the per-username limit "
"is applied."
msgstr ""
"Anfragen kommen von einem vertrauenswürdigen Proxy, aber ohne IP-Header "
"(X-Forwarded-For oder X-Real-IP); die IP lässt sich nicht bestimmen und das "
"Limit gilt nur pro Benutzername."

#: apps/core/sitehealth.py
msgid ""
"Add proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for; to the "
"proxy."
msgstr ""
"Fügen Sie dem Proxy proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For "
"$proxy_add_x_forwarded_for; hinzu."

#: apps/core/sitehealth.py
msgid ""
"No suspicious request has been seen so far; open this page through the main "
