"The theme install folder is not writable; check RAVIX_THEME_INSTALL_DIR and "
"its permissions."
msgstr ""
"Der Theme-Installationsordner ist nicht beschreibbar; prüfen Sie "
"RAVIX_THEME_INSTALL_DIR und dessen Berechtigungen."

#: apps/themes/installer.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The install folder’s file system (%(fstype)s) has no reliable locking; the "
"install was not performed to avoid conflicts. Put the install folder on a "
"local disk."
msgstr ""
"Das Dateisystem des Installationsordners (%(fstype)s) bietet keine "
"verlässliche Sperrung; die Installation wurde zur Vermeidung von Konflikten "
